OL,5,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FLocked down in their cells, the
OL,7,     Fwomen try to figure out the
OL,8,     Fsignificance of the gunfire. Vera
OL,9,     Ffeels her grip slipping, and Judy
OL,10,     Finstigates a truth game.
OL,11,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FErica warns Doreen that if her
OL,13,     Fstory is true, she could be
OL,14,     Fcharged. Vera tells Bea to keep
OL,15,     Faway from the press, and as it
OL,16,     Fcan't be fixed, all the pressing
OL,17,     Fwill have to be done by hand.
OL,18,G0100 Autopsy
OL,19,     FLooking back at the life and death
